Botling report blocks (desktop/reports/v2) bundle third-party packages into the report command
(out/report/report.cjs, shipped as Resources/report/report.cjs inside app.asar). The full licence
text of every bundled package is in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt next to this file in a build
(out/report/, Resources/report/), generated by build.mjs from the bundle's esbuild metafile.

Bundled (all unmodified): d3-scale, d3-shape and their d3-array, d3-color, d3-format,
d3-interpolate, d3-path, d3-time, d3-time-format, internmap (ISC); elkjs (EPL-2.0 OR
GPL-3.0-or-later, used under EPL-2.0; source: https://github.com/kieler/elkjs); react, react-dom,
zod, markdown-it, mdurl, linkify-it, uc.micro, punycode.js (MIT); entities (BSD-2-Clause).
Generated report HTML contains only their computed output (coordinates/paths), not their code.
